ulation time unit and energy of actual distance times 2, increased by carried mass under existing rules; charge only actual movement and continue until the interaction area or a real failure. Report represented cover geometry, reachable clear ground and locally observable conditions only. Distinguish absent cover from unrepresented or unmeasured protection; never disclose hidden environmental fields. Inspecting a tree must not add canopy geometry, shade, facilities or stock. After actual arrival, another paid observation may compare supported local measurements with earlier observations, preserving position, time and changing weather as confounders; ambient temperature alone does not establish reduced radiant exposure or body cooling. Any exposure effect must come from existing physical cover and environmental code, not the observation action. Reuse and record both existing handlers rather than claim their code as new work. If execution reveals missing cover or exposure mechanics, forward that specific gap to the current-conversation development handoff for a general, conservative implementation; do not silently invent effects or permanently rule the function impossible. Probe has one complete interaction, no banked multiround progress: cancellation or death ends an incomplete interaction without a successful observation; a new attempt is a new paid interaction. Retain actual observations and movement already completed, with no energy or time refund; navigation cancellation leaves Kai at the actual reached position and a later command starts from there. Recheck visibility, reach, occupancy and accessibility on each action. No materials are reserved, created, transformed or refundable. There is no construction or maintenance process. Remaining at a spot does not create an automatic ongoing activity: world time and environmental exposure continue normally, and cover, weather and occupancy may change. Waiting for development or review advances no world time. No mastery, inventory, permissions or protected accounts are granted.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":0,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"No happiness or experience is awarded for this request, choosing a target, invoking an interface, travel registration or mastery. This request explicitly seeks no happiness award, so these operations add none. A completed observation may establish useful new information, including an evidence-supported lack of accessible cover; an unmeasured or incomplete result must not be described as verified protection. Any physical thermal change must be calculated by existing exposure mechanics rather than awarded as mood or comfort. Do not add a comfort bonus; the global physical-comfort cap remains 10, and basic nutrition is unchanged.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse observable probe and navigation events. Observation metadata should reference actor, actual target ID when resolved, position, time, mode, completion status and evidence source; movement uses the actual traversed path and reached position. Show inspection or movement only when performed. Render shade or cover only from physically represented geometry and lighting, not a success icon, a tree's name or a remembered coordinate. Unknown, obstructed, interrupted and unsuccessful outcomes must remain visibly distinct from verified cover and completed arrival. Do not show cooling, a shelter aura or a protected state without a corresponding physical event.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"e08cbf7b-a237-48de-9981-a7f93be285b7","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section",